      "message": "wip(post): grblHAL post script and its decisions (#710)\n\nNot registered or tested yet. Still to do on this branch:\n- register in BUILTINS (crates/app/src/posting.rs), cam.d.ts and script/mod.rs post lists\n- goldens: WRITE_GOLDEN=1 cargo test -p camcraft-app --test conformance\n  (tap_plate goes into REFUSED with reason \"tapping\"; EXTENSIONS gets grblhal/nc)\n- add grblhal to the cross-post tests: comment_escape, control_comp, wear_comp,\n  post/tests/comp.rs, fanuc_post (non_rtcp), inverted_post, program_comments,\n  after_op + coolant + coolant_followups (MILLS; home refusal like Heidenhain)\n- grblhal_post.rs (header, T M6 alone, no G43/G49, dwell seconds, tap refused,\n  safe Z refused when unstated) and a generic grblhal-3axis.mch (MACHINES, machine.rs)\n- note: upstream main's lathe_thread_travel test does not build (missing field\n  'hand'); run test targets with --test, not the whole crate\n\nRefs #710",
